<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-6064] When Gluten is enabled, non-internal table build tasks encounter errors</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-6064</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Error when enabling Gluten for non-internal table build tasks: Internal Error - Class `org.apache.spark.sql.hive.HiveTableScanExecTransformer` has column support mismatch.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
