                            <comment id="17930208" author="JIRAUSER298470" created="Tue, 25 Feb 2025 09:26:57 +0000"  >&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;RootCause&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Root Cause&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Most Gluten operators cannot directly execute `executeColumnar` and will throw errors. They need to be wrapped by WholeStage for execution. The logic in KE needs to be adjusted for this.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
